      "statusChangeID": "6690fc4e7e5d7ce9c61ddbaa",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "This is a known issue that's been affecting VRChat for a while, but unfortunately it isn't as simple as moving constraints to run before physbones each frame, since that would break existing avatars that rely on physbones running first. Instead, individual physbones and constraints would need to be scheduled to run based on the dependencies between them.\n\nRunning our own constraints system opens up the possibility of fixing this. This is technically a pre-existing issue, so to help control scope, our focus for the constraints beta is on maintaining compatibility for avatars using constraints. Further improvements on top of that can be looked into later on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
